---
import SectionTitle from "@/components/shared/section-title.astro"
import { Separator } from "../ui/separator"
---

<section class="flex w-full justify-center bg-red-50 px-4">
  <div class="flex w-full max-w-7xl flex-1 flex-col py-16 lg:py-26">
    <SectionTitle
      title="Empowering Health-Tech Innovation"
      subtitle="PROGRAM OVERVIEW"
      description="Discover our core mission, key initiatives, and how we empower researchers and health-tech leaders to transform biomedical research into real-world clinical solutions."
    />

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-10">
      <div></div>

      <div class="flex flex-col gap-10">
        <div class="space-y-5">
          <h3 class="rounded-tl-full rounded-bl-full bg-red-100/50">
            <span class="mr-3 inline-block rounded-full bg-red-900 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-red-50">01</span>
            <span class="font-semibold text-red-900">Program Overview</span>
          </h3>

          <div class="space-y-5 leading-8 text-slate-700">
            <p>
              The 1st HEALTHMED-IC program is carefully curated to engage academics, clinicians, researchers, practitioners, policymakers, and
              students across disciplines, addressing complex global challenges in healthcare, emerging diseases, personalized medicine, and
              sustainable health systems. Through keynote speeches, parallel sessions, and networking opportunities, the conference ensures that
              participants share knowledge, exchange innovative ideas, and establish meaningful collaborations.
            </p>
            <p>
              As a hybrid conference, The 1st HEALTHMED-IC offers both onsite participation in Istanbul and virtual participation online, to ensure
              inclusivity, broader global engagement, and advancements in life treatment.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-5">
          <h3 class="rounded-tl-full rounded-bl-full bg-red-100/50">
            <span class="mr-3 inline-block rounded-full bg-red-900 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-red-50">02</span>
            <span class="font-semibold text-red-900">Program Highlights</span>
          </h3>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-2 text-left lg:grid-cols-2">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4 rounded-md border border-red-300 bg-red-700 p-3 text-red-50 shadow-[inset_0_0_10px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]">
              <span class="grid h-10 w-10 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border border-red-400 bg-red-500 text-red-50">1</span>

              <div>
                <p>Day 1 (November 5, 2026)<br />Conference Day</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4 rounded-md border border-red-300 bg-red-700 p-3 text-red-50 shadow-[inset_0_0_10px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]">
              <span class="grid h-10 w-10 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border border-red-400 bg-red-500 text-red-50">2</span>

              <div>
                <p>Day 2 (November 6, 2026)<br />Conference Day</p>
              </div>
            </div><div
              class="flex items-center gap-4 rounded-md border border-red-300 bg-red-700 p-3 text-red-50 shadow-[inset_0_0_10px_rgba(0,0,0,0.1)]"
            >
              <span class="grid h-10 w-10 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border border-red-400 bg-red-500 text-red-50">3</span>

              <div>
                <p>Day 3 (November 7, 2026)<br />Conference Day</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-5">
          <h3 class="rounded-tl-full rounded-bl-full bg-red-100/50">
            <span class="mr-3 inline-block rounded-full bg-red-900 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-red-50">03</span>
            <span class="font-semibold text-red-900">Detailed Schedule</span>
          </h3>

          <div class="space-y-5 text-slate-700">
            <p>
              The full program details including daily agendas, session timings, speakers, and presentation slots will be officially announced and
              published on this page no later than October 30, 2026.
            </p>
            <p>Please stay tuned for updates on the finalized schedule.</p>
            <p>
              Note: HEALTHMED-IC 2026 reserves the right to make minor adjustments to the program to optimize the experience for all participants.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
